{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109557","id":3316149852,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7FqG5c","number":109557,"title":"OccluderInstance3D | \"bake_simplification_dist\" has no effect on the baked mesh","user":{"login":"DezBoyle","id":41555304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNTU1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41555304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle","html_url":"https://github.com/DezBoyle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DezBoyle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-08-12T22:33:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T18:13:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie) 13 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620 (KBL GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8650U CPU @ 1.90GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nReading the docs for [Occlusion Culling](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/3d/occlusion_culling.html) :\n\n_If you notice low performance or stuttering in complex 3D scenes, it may mean that the CPU is overloaded as a result of rendering detailed occluders. Select the OccluderInstance3D node, increase the Bake > Simplification property then bake occluders again._\n\nIt seems like the property \"bake_simplification_dist\" / Bake Simplification Distance has no effect.  It doesn't decrease the amount of polygons in the model.\n\n### Default Settings: \n<img width=\"887\" height=\"576\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06687742-862d-4c88-bacc-5799753321c6\" />\n\n### High Simplification + rebake, does not reduce the amount of triangles\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"675\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96f50883-873d-430b-9e17-8ba682f8ba82\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a MeshInstance3D to the scene\n2. Add a OccluderInstance3D as a child\n3. Bake the occlusion\n4. change the Bake->Simplification in the inspector to a higher value\n5. Bake again\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[OccluderBakeSimplificationMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21744673/OccluderBakeSimplificationMRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109557/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}